  contexts = result.contexts or []
  print(f"Found {len(contexts)} relevant chunks")
  # Output: Found 1 relevant chunks

  print(contexts[0].content)
  # Output: "Our refund policy: We offer a 30-day money back guarantee..."
  ```
</CodeGroup>

